      "retweet": {
        "id": "2064559459960299605",
        "text": "For those impacted by the earthquake in the Philippines, Starlink Mobile is providing free connectivity to @enjoyGlobe customers in the affected regions. \n \nFamilies, communities and businesses with compatible LTE smartphones can now stay connected through select apps and SMS even if terrestrial networks are not available",
