        "media": [],
        "retweet": null,
        "quoted": {
          "id": "2064547038491262987",
          "text": "Koneksiyon direkta kanimo sa higayong kinahanglan nimo.\n\n#AlagangGlobe is bringing Globe Starlink connectivity to the provinces hardest hit by the Southern Mindanao earthquake:\n- Sarangani\n- South Cotabato\n- Sultan Kudarat\n\nFree data and SMS to ensure you always stay connected to your loved ones and to life-saving information. We continue to pray for everyone's safety and will rebuild together. #GlobeOfGood",
